# Stage 34B: Buyer Safety Copy

Use this wording across customer support and public pages where needed.

## Payment guidance

Use SokoYetu checkout and confirm the M-PESA prompt amount before entering your PIN. Keep your M-PESA receipt until the order is complete.

## Paid but order pending

If you receive an M-PESA receipt but the order still appears pending, do not pay again immediately. Submit a support request with your order ID, checkout phone number, M-PESA receipt and amount paid.

## Fraud warning

Do not share your M-PESA PIN, one-time passwords, account passwords or personal security codes with any seller, rider or support contact.

## Support evidence

When requesting support, include:

```text
order ID
checkout phone number
M-PESA receipt if available
amount paid
product name
issue type
short explanation
```
